# Per-developer config: backend/.env and frontend/.env.local hold the dev
# Cognito pool and database values. In the build context they would reach the
# frontend image through `COPY frontend/ .`, and Vite reads .env.local in
# production mode too - so a build missing a VITE_* argument would silently
# ship a bundle pointed at the dev pool. None is tracked; none belongs here.
**/.env
**/.env.*
